---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
    <article class="home-bio">
        <h1>Saksham Gupta</h1>
        <p class="subheadline">Project Lead · Oracle</p>

        <div class="bio-content">
            <p>
                I am a Project Lead at Oracle, where I lead architecture and development for
                platform orchestration frameworks, legacy modernization, and performant web
                technologies. As an IIT Roorkee Computer Science graduate, my focus lies in systems
                programming, language runtimes, and compiler design. Through my work on declarative
                DSL design and framework-agnostic rendering engines, I have optimized large-scale
                enterprise services to achieve substantial reductions in CPU usage and API latency.
            </p>

            <p>
                I joined Oracle as a Software Engineer, building the Siebel Open Integration project
                from proof-of-concept to beta within twelve months, and was subsequently promoted to
                Senior Software Engineer and Project Lead. I have led the delivery of a recursive
                JSON-driven web component framework that simplified enterprise UI extensions, and
                spearheaded our migration of core reactive systems to Java 21 virtual threads. In
                2024, my team reached the top six globally in a corporate hackathon on Generative AI
                out of over one hundred participating teams.
            </p>

            <p>
                Outside of my day job, I explore operating systems from scratch, building a custom
                32-bit UNIX clone kernel in C and assembly, alongside developing various parsers,
                caching utilities, and compiler tools. I hold a B.Tech. in Computer Science from the
                Indian Institute of Technology, Roorkee. I now focus my time primarily on writing
                deep dives on systems engineering internals, looking for the best ways to share
                technical insights about language runtimes and high-performance software
                architectures.
            </p>

            <p class="blog-cta">
                <a href="/blog">Read the blog →</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .home-bio {
        max-width: var(--max-width);
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .home-bio h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .bio-content {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .bio-content p {
        margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
        text-align: justify;
    }

    .blog-cta {
        margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    .blog-cta a {
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .blog-cta a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
